    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Enjoying a sunny, South facing, walled back garden, this attractive two bedroomed home lies at the end of a cul de sac, in this popular, mature, development off Scholarstown Road. Accommodation is bright and airy and comprises porch, living room with understairs storage, large kitchen breakfast room overlooking the mature, well planted garden, two double bedrooms and bathroom.\r\n\r\nWoodfield is situated within walking distance of a number of local schools including St.Colmcilles National & Community schools, Loreto Beaufort, Scoil Naomh Padraig primary school, Sancta Maria College and Colaiste Eanna.\r\n\r\nExcellent shopping is nearby at Knocklyon and Rathfarnham Shopping Centres and the villages of Rathfarnham and Templeogue are nearby.  Marlay Park and St Endas Park are just a few minutes away, as is the M50. \r\n\r\nAn upgraded gas fired central heating boiler has recently been fitted and double glazed windows are installed.\r\n\r\nWe highly recommend viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch                              \r\nWith sliding porch door. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\r\n5.02 x 3.72  \r\nWith marble fireplace with inset coal effect gas fire. Bay window. Coving to ceiling. Understairs storage closet.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Breakfast:    \r\n3.73 x 3.53  \r\nWith range of built in kitchen units incorporating oven hob & hood. Plumbed for washing machine/dryer. Tiled floor. Bay window with door to back garden.\r\n\r\nBed 1:          \r\n3.75 x 3.62  \r\nWith range built in sliding wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBed 2:         \r\n3.72 x 2.34  \r\nWith range built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom:   \r\n2.74 x 1.68  \r\nWith bath, w/c & washbasin. Tiled floor. Roof light. Hot press.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGross Internal Area:  \r\nc. 71 sq.m. (c.760 sq.ft.)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Situated at end of small cul de sac.\r\n- Mature development with large green open space.\r\n- Private off street parking.\r\n- Cobblelock driveway.\r\n- Entrance porch.\r\n- Red brick elevation.\r\n- Double glazed windows.\r\n- Gas fired radiator central heating.\r\n- Upgraded Gas boiler recently fitted.\r\n- Sunny, South facing, walled back garden with patio area.\r\n- Spacious Kitchen / Breakfast overlooking back garden.\r\n- Two Double Bedrooms.\r\n- Floor area c. 71 sq.m.\r\n- Adjacent to a host of amenities – Schools, Shopping, Parks.\r\n- Easy access to M50.\r\n- Carpets & window blinds as fitted included in sale\r\n- Barna garden shed included in sale\r\n\r\n\r\nBER: C\r\nNo. 119863132"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C\r\nNo. 119863132"
      }
